  "prefLabel": "Pol 101.32 Police academy",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 101.32 \"Police academy\" means the basic training for full-time police officers which is conducted or approved by the council in accordance with the requirements contained in these rules.\n\nSource. #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7301, eff 6-8-00",
